    "preamble": "Vignesh vs The Commissioner on 12 March, 2024 Author: G.R.Swaminathan Bench: G.R.Swaminathan W.P(MD)No.4 Before The Madurai Bench Of Madras High Court Dated : 12.03.2024 Coram The Honourable Mr.Justice G.R.Swaminathan W.P(MD)No.4191 of 2024 and W.M.P(MD)Nos.4034, 4036 & 4037 of 2024 Vignesh ... Petit Vs. 1.The Commissioner, Tamil Nadu Food Safety and Drug Administration Department, DMS Campus, 5th Floor, No.359, Anna Salai, Teynampet, Chennai 600 006. 2.The Designated Officer, Tamil Nadu Food Safety and Drug Administration Department, Food Safety Wing, Trichy District . ... Respo Prayer : Writ Petition filed under Article 226 of the Constitution praying this Court to issue a Writ of Certiorari, to call for the r 1/4 https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis W.P( Vignesh vs The Commissioner on 12 March, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/70367152/ 1 pertaining to the Impugned notice issued in 3056/Vu.Pa.Thu/Trichy/2023/9/1/24 dated 09.01.2024 passed by the second respondent and quash the same as illegal and unconstitutiona For Petitioner : Mr.B.Jameelarasu For Respondents : Mr.T.Villavan Kothai Additional Government Pleader ORDER He also made an endorsement to this effect.",
